# Drop your custom VGMplug_custom.py here, renamed to VGMplug.py.
#
# At build time the Dockerfile dynamically locates the `beetsplug` namespace
# package inside site-packages (so the path isn't tied to a Python version)
# and copies every .py file from this directory into it. Any module name
# that collides with one installed by pip (e.g. a `beetsplug.VGMplug` from
# the beets-vgmdb pip package — currently not installed) gets overridden by
# the file you drop here.
#
# The build will FAIL if this directory contains no .py files — the helper
# has nothing to do without the custom plugin, so a silent skip would be
# worse than a loud error.
